@startuml Feature7_Seq_1
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam minClassWidth 100

title **Feature 7: Department Management - Sequence: Create Department**

actor Admin
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "<<controller>>\nDepartmentController" as Ctrl
participant "<<service>>\nDepartmentService" as Svc
participant "<<repository>>\nDepartmentRepository" as Repo
participant "<<dbcontext>>\nAppDbContext" as DbContext
participant "Database" as DB

Admin -> UI: Enter Department Info
activate UI

UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/departments
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: CreateAsync(companyId, dto)
activate Svc

Svc -> Repo: NameExistsAsync(companyId, dto.Name)
activate Repo
Repo --> Svc: return false
deactivate Repo

note right of Svc: Validate ManagerUserId\n(Optional)

Svc -> Repo: InsertAsync(department)
activate Repo
Repo -> DbContext: Add & SaveChanges
activate DbContext
DbContext -> DB: Execute SQL INSERT
activate DB
DB --> DbContext: success
deactivate DB
DbContext --> Repo: return departmentId
deactivate DbContext
Repo --> Svc: return departmentId
deactivate Repo

Svc -> Repo: GetByIdAsync(companyId, departmentId)
activate Repo
Repo --> Svc: return Department entity
deactivate Repo

Svc --> Ctrl: return DepartmentDto
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: return JSON
deactivate Ctrl

UI --> Admin: Show success message
deactivate UI
@enduml
